# Pull requests in English

When creating or updating pull requests (title, body, review replies meant for the PR):

- Always write in **English**, even if the user chats in another language
- Keep commit messages in English unless the repo already uses another language consistently
- Chat replies to the user may stay in the user's language (e.g. Brazilian Portuguese)

## Examples

```text
✅ Title: fix(ui): fit Favorites empty state without gray nav strip
❌ Title: corrige estado vazio dos Favoritos sem barra cinza

✅ Body:
## Summary
- Scale empty-state illustration to the usable viewport

## Test plan
- [ ] Open Favorites as guest and confirm CTA is visible

❌ Body in Portuguese for the PR description
```
